<section class="art-series art-series--snow" id="selected-art">
  <div class="art-shell">
    <header class="art-series-heading"><div><p class="art-index">01</p><h2>Snow paintings on glass</h2></div><p>I apply decorative snow spray directly to glass, then use brushes and scrapers to shape trees, edges and textures. Everything is drawn freehand, never from a stencil. What I love most is that the image is never quite the same. Daylight changes it throughout the day; in the evening, added lights turn it into a warm winter scene.</p></header>
    <div class="art-gallery-row" aria-label="Snow paintings on glass">
      <figure class="art-gallery-card art-gallery-card--snow-mountain" tabindex="0"><img src="{{ '/assets/art/snow-mountain-village.jpg' | url }}" alt="Snow-painted mountain rising above a winter village on a large window" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Mountain Village</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="art-gallery-card art-gallery-card--snow-detail" tabindex="0"><img src="{{ '/assets/art/snow-village-detail.jpg' | url }}" alt="Detail of a village painted in snow medium on glass" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Winter Village</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="art-gallery-card art-gallery-card--hogwarts" tabindex="0"><img src="{{ '/assets/art/hogwarts.jpg' | url }}" alt="Hogwarts castle painted in snow medium on a window" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Hogwarts</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="art-gallery-card art-gallery-card--context" tabindex="0"><img src="{{ '/assets/art/winter-village.jpg' | url }}" alt="Room view showing the scale of a winter landscape painted across a large window" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>In the room</span><small>Scale and context</small></figcaption></figure>
