<section class="art-series art-series--drawing">
  <div class="art-shell">
    <header class="art-series-heading"><div><p class="art-index">02</p><h2>Drawing and illustration</h2></div><p>Drawing was both the beginning of my creative work and the way back to it; I started again when I illustrated a reader for my daughter. Pencil and paper teach me to balance the whole with the detail, while shading can completely change an image’s depth and mood. That may be why I care so much about light and shadow in digital interfaces too.</p></header>
    <div class="art-gallery-row" aria-label="Drawing and illustration">
      <figure class="art-gallery-card art-gallery-card--witch" tabindex="0"><img src="{{ '/assets/art/little-witch.jpg' | url }}" alt="Marker illustration of a little witch flying away from a swarm of bees" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Little Witch</span><small>Marker illustration</small></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="art-gallery-card art-gallery-card--phoenix" tabindex="0"><img src="{{ '/assets/art/phoenix-study.jpg' | url }}" alt="Detailed drawing of a phoenix with wings spread" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Phoenix</span></figcaption></figure>
